ing character heirlooms  but you're scared that the rng gods will  curse you with the exact one you don't  want one system override starts you  don't have to worry about that instead  of randomly earning an heirloom from  opening apex packs players will instead  earn heirloom shards with these shards  you can construct whichever heirloom you  want whether you want Wraith bloodhound  lifeline or Pathfinder one system  override ends the octane heirloom will  be added to the pool to this heirloom  system will stick around even after  system overwrite ends and that's  everything there is to know about system  override ahead of the event are you  excited to see King's candy returned  once again are you curious as to the  effectiveness of the Evo shield let us  know in the comments section below  [Music]
 

